/*!
    \page qtquickstudiocomponents-index.html
    \title Qt Quick Studio Components
    \brief Provides QML types for basic shapes.

    Qt Quick Studio Components make it easy to create common shapes. This module is supported
    by Qt Design Studio.

    \section1 Getting Started

    To import the QML types into your application, use the following import
    statement in your \c{.qml} file:

    \code
    import QtQuick.Studio.Components
    \endcode

